{"ref":"BDB, בֶּ֫רֶךְ","hw":"בֶּ֫רֶךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֫רֶךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.23\">Is. 45:23</a></sup> <strong>knee (</strong>Assyrian <em>birku</em> Ethiopic ብርክ Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּרֶךְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܪܽܘܟ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رُكْنَةٌ</span> <strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.23\">Is 45:23</a>; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּרְכַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:12\" href=\"/Job.3.12\">Jb 3:12</a> + 10 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּרְכַּי</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:3\" href=\"/Genesis.30.3\">Gn 30:3</a> + 11 times;—<em>knee, knees:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מים ברכים</span> water reaching to the knees <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.4\">Ez 47:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּנִיעֵנִי על ברכי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:10\" href=\"/Daniel.10.10\">Dn 10:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַכְּכָה בשׁחין רע על הברכים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.35\">Dt 28:35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כרע על ברכים</span> <em>kneel on knees</em> in worship <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:54\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.54\">1 K 8:54</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:5\" href=\"/Ezra.9.5\">Ezr 9:5</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.23\">Is 45:23</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.18\">1 K 19:18</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.13\">2 Ch 6:13</a>, in entreaty <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.13\">2 K 1:13</a>, to drink of a fountain <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5\" href=\"/Judges.7.5\">Ju 7:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:6\" href=\"/Judges.7.6\">6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂם פניו בין ברכיו</span> <em>put his face between his knees</em> in prayer <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:42\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.42\">1 K 18:42</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">על ברכים</span> <em>upon the knees</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:3\" href=\"/Genesis.30.3\">Gn 30:3</a> (E; on <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּלֵד עַל ב׳</span> v. Ploss<sup>Das Weib Aufl. 2. ii. 180 ff.</sup> Sta<sup>ZAW 1886, 143 ff.</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:23\" href=\"/Genesis.50.23\">50:23</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Job 3:12\" href=\"/Job.3.12\">Jb 3:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:19\" href=\"/Judges.16.19\">Ju 16:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.20\">2 K 4:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.12\">Is 6:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הוציא מעם ברכים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:12\" href=\"/Genesis.48.12\">Gn 48:12</a> (E); knees as seat of strength, weak from terror <a data-ref=\"Job 4:4\" href=\"/Job.4.4\">Jb 4:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.3\">Is 35:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.17\">Ez 7:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.12\">21:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:11\" href=\"/Nahum.2.11\">Na 2:11</a>; or fasting <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:24\" href=\"/Psalms.109.24\">ψ 109:24</a>.","next":"BDB, בִּרָכָה","prev":"BDB, בָּרַךְ"}